@startuml F5.6-ERRO-02-sem-vagas
title F5.6-ERRO-02 — 422 matrícula sem vagas
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "StudentController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar matrícula
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /matricula
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: checar vagas
Postgres --> Ctrl: vagas = 0
note right of Ctrl
  sem BEGIN TX
end note
Ctrl --> WebApp: 422 no_vacancies
WebApp --> Sec: Drawer aberto

@enduml
